WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:00.959
Interviewer:
Messi, take one.

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:02.877
Interviewer: 
Are you ready for the World Cup?

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:05.547
Fans:
Messi! Messi!

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:06.631
Messi: 
I'm ready and

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.340
Messi:
with great desire

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.258
Messi: 
very excited.

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.676
Fans:
Messi!

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.301
Messi: 
to win

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:10.760
Messi: 
the World Cup.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.554
It would be the dream ending.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.474
Announcer:
The 2022 World Cup.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:16.891
[cheering]

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:18.727
It’s sixty-four Super Bowls-

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.228
Andres:
-rolled into one month.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:23.064
Announcer:
This might mark the final time we witness Lionel Messi.

00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:28.153
Announcer:
Throughout his seventeen year career,
Messi has yet to secure the ultimate prize.

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:30.613
It was obvious that he was going to be great.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.449
Gary:
It was just a question of-

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.158
[drum beats]

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:35.702
-how great?

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:38.747
Football is part of the Argentinian DNA.

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:39.497
[cheering]

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:42.083
Come 2022, the pressure was on Lionel-

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:45.795
Roger:
-because he’d never delivered
ultimate glory on the world stage.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:47.005
Announcer:
It’s a miss!

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.340
People are always demanding more from their idols.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.469
Victor:
It's unbearable to be Messi.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.596
Victor:
But it's extraordinary to be Messi.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.890
Gaston:
Messi is starting to crumble.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.558
It’s a moment of great tension.

00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:00.226
Gaston:
But before he hits the ground...

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:01.436
If we lose we go home.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.395
Gaston:
 ...he stands up.

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.106
He said I can't fail you.

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:06.608
Sergio:
I need to win.

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.319
Andres:
He plays for glory.

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:10.737
Andres:
He plays for pride.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:15.533
Announcer:
Messi is Argentina, Argentina are Messi.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.411
My journey wasn't easy.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:21.414
[cheering]

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:22.540
Messi: This is my last shot.

